# Hyperion contract interface capability snapshot.
#
# This file is the reviewed record of one surface's public methods and advertised routes.
# The Rust, Foundry and protocol suites read it; changing the contract without changing
# this file is a failing test. See docs/INTERFACE_CAPABILITIES.md before editing.
#
# Development surface only. The active deployment is Stellar Testnet outbound ITS/CCTP;
# EVM dispatch is not active until independently validated.
surface evm/router
contract HyperionRouter
status gated
# Public callable methods, sorted.
method DEFAULT_ADMIN_ROLE
method EIP712_DOMAIN_TYPEHASH
method GRACE_PERIOD
method GUARDIAN_ROLE
method MAX_CLAIMS_PER_BATCH
method MAX_FLOW_WINDOW
method MAX_REASON_LEN
